      {
        "id": 53427,
        "name": "Amnachaidh",
        "username": "Amnachaidh",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-24T14:33:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/how-to-beat-advanced-spite-2577\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/how-to-beat-advanced-spite-2577</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hello, and welcome to the boards!&nbsp; Let me recommend Flamethrower49's excellent strategy guides, located in the fixed section of this forum.&nbsp; The guides have been very helpful for me, especially with the more complcated characters.&nbsp; Absolute Zero went from marginal to devestating under the guide's direction.</p><p>I am 2 for 3 against Spite, and a fairly new player.&nbsp; That said, I think you played it about right.&nbsp; He tanks up - the heroes tank up.&nbsp; Big fight against a static foe once he goes all Tetsuo from Akira.&nbsp; I try to save the victims, but I think that tactically it generally doesn't make sense to do so.<br>A \"turn\" is one character's or the environement's turn - So H+2 turns per round.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:27:36.520Z",
